5,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I worry about relying on external factors. Let's check our past reliability.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,We always judge by sound. I want to see what actually happened before.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shion,,Efficiency is key. I need to know if we have the capacity to absorb this.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Minako,,"The numbers look fine now, but I suspect the structure is flawed.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I am quiet, but I feel the weight of these choices.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Benjamin, do you think looking back helps us move forward?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"It prevents us from repeating expensive mistakes, Yumi. That is all.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shion,,I am not interested in sentiment. I need hard data on our limits.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Minako,,"Agreed. We must understand the skeleton of the budget, not just the skin.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I just want to make sure no one is left behind in the shuffle.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I will look at our recent operational lines to see where we slipped.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will examine the two programmes begun six years ago.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shion,,I will check the volunteer register and the supervision training records.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Minako,,I will review the county grant terms and the endowment details.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I will look at the bus links in the two outer wards.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Yumi,,It feels safer to know exactly where the ground is soft.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"History is a mirror, not a cage. We just need to look.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shion,,"If the skills aren't there, the plan is dead on arrival.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Minako,,I trust the structure more than the promises. Let's see the fine print.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I hope the connections hold. I am a bit nervous about this.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
