60,3,1,talk,Yumi,,"Option C feels right. It uses people, not just things. It is resilient.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,Option B is a trap. We tried digitisation before and it failed. Do not repeat it.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Shion,,Option A requires tools and space. We have neither. Option C uses existing volunteers.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Minako,,Option D is a budget black hole. The vehicle costs will eat us alive.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,Option C... it connects people. It feels safe. I like it.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Shion, do you think the volunteers can handle the language circles?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,The evening groups worked. Language circles are similar. They are low-cost and high-impact.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Shion,,Yes. The register shows retired teachers. They are perfect for this. No new hires needed.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Minako,,I agree. No capital expenditure. No new fixed lines. It fits the grant structure perfectly.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,It helps the outer wards too. They can join the circles without traveling far.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Yumi,,I am convinced. Option C is the one. It is kind and practical.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,"I concur. The data supports it. The previous failures were in hardware, not community.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Shion,,I will vote for C. It is the only logical choice given our constraints.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Minako,,I will vote for C. It is the only option that does not break the budget in year two.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I will vote for C. It feels like the right thing to do for everyone.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Yumi,,It is settled then. We choose the people.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Benjamin,,A wise choice. Let us not look back at this one.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Shion,,Efficient. I am satisfied. Let us proceed.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Minako,,The structure holds. I am confident in this decision.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Daisuke,,Thank you. I feel a little lighter now.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
